{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39237","headline":"李氏小池亭十二韵 · 韦庄","name":"李氏小池亭十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积石乱巉巉，庭莎绿不芟。\n小桥低跨水，危槛半依岩。\n花落鱼争唼，樱红鸟竞鵮。\n引泉疏地脉，扫絮积山嵌。\n古柳红绡织，新篁紫绮缄。\n养猿秋啸月，放鹤夜栖杉。\n枕簟谿云腻，池塘海雨咸。\n语窗鸡逞辨，舐鼎犬偏馋。\n踏藓青粘屐，攀萝绿映衫。\n访僧舟北渡，贳酒日西衔。\n迟客登高阁，题诗遶翠岩。\n家藏何所宝，清韵满琅函。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}